# Snyk Security Extension - AI Rules (auto-generated)
.cursor/rules/snyk_rules.mdc

# app/Modules holds the plugins WE build — Shiprocket and PayU — so it IS tracked.
# Ignoring it cost the Shiprocket source twice: uninstalling deletes the folder, and an
# untracked folder has no copy to come back from. Keeping plugins out of CLIENT builds
# is the packaging scripts' job, which they do explicitly (and the client script asserts
# it), so git tracking leaks nothing. A plugin bought from someone else and installed on
# a dev machine is the one thing not to commit here.
